{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/readiumshared\/bufferingresource"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BufferingResource"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Expensive interaction with the underlying resource is minimized, since most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(smaller) requests can be satisfied by accessing the buffer alone. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drawback is that some extra space is required to hold the buffer and that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copying takes place when filling that buffer, but this is usually","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outweighed by the performance benefits.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that this implementation is pretty limited and the benefits are only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"apparent when reading forward and consecutively – e.g. when downloading the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resource by chunks. The buffer is ignored when reading backward or far","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ahead.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/BufferingResource"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/BufferingResource\/init(resource:bufferSize:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"i